	quest.0367FE53FC0CC35B.quest_desc: ["Once you've crafted a &1Dormant Deepshelf&r, you need to infuse it. This infusion recipe will require some extra blocks to reach the stat threshold. Completing the infusion will yield a  &0Deepshelf&r, which can get you to Level 70."]
